Tried it.  Didn't work.  The login process would occasionally fail to
the point that the sytems had to be rebooted before anybody could get
on.  DEC service first denied that this should ever work until I
pointed out the place in the manuals where they suggested it.  If it
was fixable, I couldn't afford constant failures while the bugs were
