Christian Worley (cworley@altatech.com) wrote:
: Jeremy Anderson wrote:
: > 
: > I'm trying to setup PPP & Gated on DU 4.0, but not having much luck.  I've
: > read through all the man pages, but they're a wee bit technical, especially
: > for someone who hasn't done ppp/gated setup before.
