Simon

Our resident Loader expert says the following:


RLD_VERSION = 0 is not valid.  RLD_VERSION must be either 1, 2 or 3.

It's likely that Simon P Smith is trying to run a corrupted object.
I can duplicate the problem pretty easily be patching a non-shared
exec to look like a call-shared exec and trying to run it.

% a.out
1262:a.out: /sbin/loader: Fatal Error: Main 's RLD_VERSION is 0, the
correct version should be 3


This is because there is no .dynamic section, and therefore no
RLD_VERSION.

{From Randy Lowell}

Hope this helps

Don Courtney Base DE group/USG


