>We will probably need to go to DU 4.0. Does anyone know if this
>is possible in a direct upgrade, or do you have to step through
>some versions in between. ( 3.0, 3.2 or whateever ? )

I would recommend upgrading directly, going from 2.0 to 2.1 to 3.2 to
3.2C to 4.0 to 4.0B was a day wasted (especially if your / partition
