This sounds like your running this on a 4.0 or later system.  You
need to put a copy of libXt.so that ships on the kit in

	/usr/lib/netscape/libXt.so

into the same directory as netscape and set your LD_LIBRARY_PATH
environment variable to that path to use that libXt.so instead of
the one in /usr/shlib/libXt.so

cp /usr/lib/netscape/libXt.so /usr/local/netscape/
export LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/usr/local/netscape
/usr/local/netscape/netscape

Sean



