You need to mount the freeware cd with the rockridge option on the
mount command line.

	mount -r -t cdfs -o rrip /dev/rz4c /freeware

When you don't use the '-o rrip' option you get regular ISO9660 level 1
or level 2 depending on which way the cd was made.

